{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"26日から、乃木坂駅の発車メロディーが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「君の名は希望」ピアノ音になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が実際に弾いたものを使っていただいてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいことだぁーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆかりのある駅にこんな形で関われて、とっても光栄です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもう乃木坂駅行きましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も早く生で聞きたいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/03/29/2440262/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて乃木中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グアムまだ負け残っております！>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タカダディスコほんっとすごかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衝撃のアトラクション。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな激しくて安全バーないなんて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10分くらい操り回されてたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"降りたあと顔が険しくなってました...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハードだったなぁ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなんだかんだワーキャーたのしかったよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/03/29/2440262/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/03/29/2440262/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragrap